{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Make the state-release test deterministic.** `System.gc()` is only a hint and may be disabled, so this can fail after the polling window even when nothing retains the instances. Replace the GC assertion with a package-private scheduler ownership/queue inspection; keep weak references as diagnostics only.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7wrPbz","finding_digest":"a662591ec6e4e83d418f180c320a5572f894901baa4c343f9183d995155bf243","finding_id":"arf_v1_uzrfshwg4tud2qmpdagdecsvol","finding_key":"insight-plugin/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/statecleanuplifecycletest.java::allcollected::nondeterministic-gc-assertion","identity_key":"insight-plugin/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/statecleanuplifecycletest.java::allcollected::nondeterministic-gc-assertion","line":96,"observation_digest":"a1be96acaca5b01b2344310f23e1a4222e44b3a4d61e6df5d9d1176e14fa251c","observation_id":"aro_v1_ug7jnlfmuwybwi2egehshyneei","path":"insight-plugin/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/StateCleanupLifecycleTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-17T14:16:52Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ngxfyv63p4lqudenuthqx2ntut","reviewed_base_sha":"adb57764dd7b0d927e52f756ecb9bca4eb0f5a91","reviewed_head_sha":"6cca5434eabe54d85f0c08613b2938245c70d29e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":96,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_3kjg4nzjvg7bnxuj2bophztdkt","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T14:16:52Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
